01:54:46.914 --> 01:54:48.914
In the same way.

1018
01:54:48.914 --> 01:54:54.914
Not in the same way as in birth, but in the same way as he went, that same Jesus will return.

1019
01:54:54.914 --> 01:54:56.914
Do you believe that?

1020
01:54:56.994 --> 01:55:03.474
Because this is the most important question, I think, that I can ask you during a Christmas service.

1021
01:55:03.474 --> 01:55:05.474
Do you believe that he will come back?

1022
01:55:05.474 --> 01:55:07.474
Verse 25.

1023
01:55:07.474 --> 01:55:13.074
But we are looking forward to something that is not yet here and we are certain that it will come.

1024
01:55:13.074 --> 01:55:19.074
Therefore, we wait for it with full confidence, have faith, patiently.

1025
01:55:19.074 --> 01:55:23.074
My last Bible verse, Revelation 21.

1026
01:55:23.074 --> 01:55:25.074
Hallelujah, hallelujah.

1027
01:55:25.234 --> 01:55:27.234
Revelation 21.

1028
01:55:30.674 --> 01:55:34.674
Are we learning something from this diagram?

1029
01:55:34.674 --> 01:55:36.674
That's cool, you'll never forget this.

1030
01:55:36.674 --> 01:55:38.674
At least, I will never forget this.

1031
01:55:40.674 --> 01:55:42.674
Hallelujah.

1032
01:55:42.674 --> 01:55:44.674
Why did I draw this?

1033
01:55:44.674 --> 01:55:46.674
Here you have an earthly timeline.

1034
01:55:46.674 --> 01:55:50.674
And here we draw that heavenly timeline.

1035
01:55:50.674 --> 01:55:52.674
That's why it is so.

1036
01:55:52.674 --> 01:55:58.674
The real diagram minus all my scribbles is thus, thus, thus, thus.

1037
01:55:58.674 --> 01:56:00.674
That is the diagram if you want to make drawings.

1038
01:56:00.674 --> 01:56:02.674
Revelation 21.

1039
01:56:02.674 --> 01:56:04.674
Are you there? Say amen.

1040
01:56:04.674 --> 01:56:08.674
And I saw a new heaven and a new earth.

1041
01:56:08.674 --> 01:56:10.674
There. This.

1042
01:56:10.674 --> 01:56:14.674
And I saw a new heaven and a new earth.

1043
01:56:14.674 --> 01:56:19.674
For the first heaven and the first earth had passed away.

1044
01:56:19.674 --> 01:56:21.674
And what is written there?

1045
01:56:21.674 --> 01:56:25.674
And the sea was no more.

1046
01:56:25.674 --> 01:56:29.674
The age of water was no more.

1047
01:56:29.674 --> 01:56:31.674
That is why it is written there.

1048
01:56:31.674 --> 01:56:35.674
And the sea was no more.

1049
01:56:35.674 --> 01:56:39.674
There are no rituals in heaven anymore.

1050
01:56:39.674 --> 01:56:41.674
To make things right with the Father.

1051
01:56:41.674 --> 01:56:43.674
That is no more.

1052
01:56:43.674 --> 01:56:45.674
There will be no more tears.

1053
01:56:45.674 --> 01:56:47.674
There is no pain.

1054
01:56:47.674 --> 01:56:49.674
There is no addiction.

1055
01:56:49.674 --> 01:56:51.674
There is no sickness.

1056
01:56:51.674 --> 01:56:53.674
There is no war.

1057
01:56:53.674 --> 01:56:55.674
There is no terrorism.

1058
01:56:55.674 --> 01:56:57.674
There is no wokeness.

1059
01:56:57.674 --> 01:56:59.674
There is nothing more.

1060
01:56:59.674 --> 01:57:01.674
It is over.

1061
01:57:01.674 --> 01:57:03.674
Praise the Lord.

1062
01:57:03.674 --> 01:57:05.674
And therefore it says.

1063
01:57:05.674 --> 01:57:07.674
And the sea was no more.

1064
01:57:07.674 --> 01:57:09.674
The age of water is gone.

1065
01:57:09.674 --> 01:57:13.674
And I, John, saw the holy city, the new Jerusalem, coming down out of heaven.

1066
01:57:13.674 --> 01:57:15.674
From God.

1067
01:57:15.674 --> 01:57:19.674
And I stood out like a bride who has made herself beautiful for her bridegroom.

1068
01:57:19.674 --> 01:57:23.674
From heaven I heard a voice loudly saying.

1069
01:57:23.674 --> 01:57:27.674
This is the place where God will dwell among the people.

1070
01:57:27.674 --> 01:57:29.674
They will be His people.

1071
01:57:29.674 --> 01:57:33.674
And God, Emmanuel, will be with them.

1072
01:57:33.674 --> 01:57:35.674
He will be their God.

1073
01:57:35.674 --> 01:57:37.674
He will wipe away every tear from their eyes.

1074
01:57:37.674 --> 01:57:39.674
And death will be no more.

1075
01:57:39.674 --> 01:57:43.674
No one will be sad, mourn, or have pain any longer.

1076
01:57:43.674 --> 01:57:45.674
For the former things have passed away.

1077
01:57:45.674 --> 01:57:47.674
And He who sits on the throne.

1078
01:57:47.674 --> 01:57:49.674
Shall we please stand.

1079
01:57:49.674 --> 01:57:51.674
And shall we say this together.

1080
01:57:51.674 --> 01:57:53.674
And He who sits on the throne said.

1081
01:57:53.674 --> 01:57:57.674
I make all things new.

1082
01:57:57.674 --> 01:57:59.674
Hallelujah. We will say it one more time.

1083
01:57:59.674 --> 01:58:01.674
I make all things new.

1084
01:58:01.674 --> 01:58:03.674
Can we close our eyes.

1085
01:58:03.674 --> 01:58:05.674
For I want to pray for you.

1086
01:58:05.674 --> 01:58:07.674
Hallelujah.

1087
01:58:09.674 --> 01:58:11.674
Hallelujah. Close your eyes.

1088
01:58:11.674 --> 01:58:13.674
I want to pray for you.

1089
01:58:13.674 --> 01:58:15.674
While I read verse 6 once more.

1090
01:58:15.674 --> 01:58:17.674
It is finished.

1091
01:58:17.674 --> 01:58:19.674
I am the first and the last, says Jesus.

1092
01:58:19.674 --> 01:58:23.674
I am the beginning and the end of the plan.

1093
01:58:23.674 --> 01:58:25.674
The people who are thirsty.

1094
01:58:25.674 --> 01:58:27.674
Age of water.

1095
01:58:27.674 --> 01:58:29.674
People who are thirsty.

1096
01:58:29.674 --> 01:58:33.674
I will give them to drink from the spring of the water that gives life.

1097
01:58:33.674 --> 01:58:35.674
No more washing on the outside.

1098
01:58:35.674 --> 01:58:37.674
No more making it difficult.

1099
01:58:37.674 --> 01:58:39.674
No more pretending to be better than you are.

1100
01:58:39.674 --> 01:58:41.674
No more putting on masks.

1101
01:58:41.674 --> 01:58:43.674
No more toiling and trying your best.

1102
01:58:43.674 --> 01:58:47.674
No more three steps forward, two steps back.

1103
01:58:47.674 --> 01:58:49.674
If you want Jesus, you can have Jesus.

1104
01:58:49.674 --> 01:58:53.674
And He will give you water that is truly water.

1105
01:58:53.674 --> 01:58:55.674
Hallelujah.

1106
01:58:55.674 --> 01:58:57.674
Lord, I want to pray for everyone in this room.

1107
01:58:57.674 --> 01:58:59.674
Lord, whether people know Jesus personally or not.

1108
01:58:59.674 --> 01:59:01.674
Or they are here visiting the church.

1109
01:59:01.674 --> 01:59:03.674
And they are watching what is being said.

1110
01:59:03.674 --> 01:59:05.674
I want to bless everyone.

1111
01:59:05.674 --> 01:59:07.674
In Jesus' name.

1112
01:59:07.674 --> 01:59:09.674
That the gospel that has just been preached.

1113
01:59:09.674 --> 01:59:11.674
Will penetrate.

1114
01:59:11.674 --> 01:59:13.674
And will be preached again by King Jesus.

1115
01:59:13.674 --> 01:59:15.674
In the hearts of all people.

1116
01:59:15.674 --> 01:59:17.674
Lord, I want us to celebrate Christmas not.

1117
01:59:17.674 --> 01:59:19.674
Because of something cozy.

1118
01:59:19.674 --> 01:59:21.674
But that we may learn to know Jesus personally.

1119
01:59:21.674 --> 01:59:25.674
And that we will drink the wine of the revelation of King Jesus.

1120
01:59:25.674 --> 01:59:29.674
And that we will be grafted into Jesus Christ.

1121
01:59:29.674 --> 01:59:31.674
The true vine.

1122
01:59:31.674 --> 01:59:33.674
Father, I want to pray for everyone in this room.

1123
01:59:33.674 --> 01:59:35.674
Lord, I want to pray for the people who are struggling.

1124
01:59:35.674 --> 01:59:37.674
To believe in God.

1125
01:59:37.674 --> 01:59:39.674
Or to trust Him.

1126
01:59:39.674 --> 01:59:41.674
We just read in Romans chapter 8.

1127
01:59:41.674 --> 01:59:43.674
That we must trust Him.

1128
01:59:43.674 --> 01:59:45.674
That we must trust His plan.

1129
01:59:45.674 --> 01:59:47.674
Jesus says.

1130
01:59:47.674 --> 01:59:49.674
I am the beginning and the end.

1131
01:59:49.674 --> 01:59:51.674
I will also finish it.

1132
01:59:51.674 --> 01:59:53.674
Maybe you find yourself at this moment.

1133
01:59:53.674 --> 01:59:55.674
We all find ourselves.

1134
01:59:55.674 --> 01:59:57.674
In this already not yet age of wine.

1135
01:59:57.674 --> 01:59:59.674
Maybe you have questions.

1136
01:59:59.674 --> 02:00:01.674
Difficulties.

1137
02:00:01.674 --> 02:00:03.674
And you think to yourself.

1138
02:00:03.674 --> 02:00:05.674
I just don't see it.

1139
02:00:05.674 --> 02:00:07.674
I am just discouraged.

1140
02:00:07.674 --> 02:00:09.674
I just don't see it.

1141
02:00:09.674 --> 02:00:11.674
I want to bless you.

1142
02:00:11.674 --> 02:00:13.674
In the name of Jesus.

1143
02:00:13.674 --> 02:00:15.674
That you will regain trust.

1144
02:00:15.674 --> 02:00:17.674
In the God of the Bible.

1145
02:00:17.674 --> 02:00:19.674
That you will gain trust.

1146
02:00:19.674 --> 02:00:21.674
In the heavenly plan of Jesus.

1147
02:00:21.674 --> 02:00:23.674
And that you will see.

1148
02:00:23.674 --> 02:00:25.674
That He is working it out.

1149
02:00:25.674 --> 02:00:27.674
In your life.

1150
02:00:27.674 --> 02:00:29.674
In Jesus' name. Amen.

1151
02:00:29.674 --> 02:00:31.674
Shall we give Him a round of applause.

1152
02:00:33.674 --> 02:00:35.674
Praise God. Hallelujah.

1153
02:00:35.674 --> 02:00:37.674
Debbie comes to the stage.

1154
02:00:37.674 --> 02:00:39.674
To give a few announcements.

1155
02:00:39.674 --> 02:00:41.674
About the fellowship we are going to have now.

1156
02:00:41.674 --> 02:00:43.674
I hope we have all learned.

1157
02:00:43.674 --> 02:00:45.674
About the age of water and age of wine.

1158
02:00:45.674 --> 02:00:47.674
Tomorrow there is no prayer.

1159
02:00:47.674 --> 02:00:49.674
And worship.

1160
02:00:49.674 --> 02:00:51.674
So do not come to the church.

1161
02:00:51.674 --> 02:00:53.674
Unless you want to sweep the sidewalk.

1162
02:00:53.674 --> 02:00:55.674
Here is Debbie.
